ing.\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "", "text": "Have you ever felt nervous speaking in front of your class or some other group of people? Most people get nervous if they speak in public. When they don't feel any stress, it's nice, but unusual.", "id": 1}, {"time": "12000", "image": "", "text": "According to some advice given to actors,  if you're nervous, you want to do a good job. Most actors have felt this to varying degrees before they walked onto the stage and faced their audience. Some have even asked someone backstage to give them a push when they felt more stage fright than usual. If you ask stage actors about this, most admit it freely. It happens to everyone at least once.<br /><br />Getting over that nervous feeling is just one challenge for theater actors. They have to memorize lines, remember where to stand, and of course, be convincing. They also do it live. It has to be right the first time, every time!", "id": 2}, {"time": "53000", "image": "", "text": "When I asked an actor friend what I should do when I was nervous, he said, \u201cYou should try imagining the crowd is naked! I did that once. Do you think you might find a place to stretch to relax? I've done that for years. You could always chew gum to ease the tension in your jaw as well. When your stomach has butterflies, a banana helps. I've eaten a banana on opening night!\u201d<br /><br />I thought, \u201c Yes, I should do that!\u201d, \u201cI agree, stretching sounds good!\u201d \u201cChewing gum, is a possibility!\u201d, and \u201cNo, bananas aren't for me!\u201d Problem solved. Just don't ever ask me to step out onto a Broadway stage!", "id": 3}], "video_src": "engenn9le17ob09re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}